 folks arriving in Toronto looking to meet new people.\nThe event will incl
 ude a run-down of the rules for new players or anyone who wants them\, whi
 le those seeking to test their skills will be paired together for a fun ev
 ening of gaming.\nThanks to the generosity of Something in the Water\, we 
