 ands as one of the defining chapters of his six-decade career. Dividing hi
 s time between Canada and Portugal\, he devoted nearly two decades from th
 e late 1980s until the mid 2000s to photographing the Azores and mainland 
 Portugal.These years produced some of his most poetic work which is featur
 ed in this exhibition.\nFree Admission\, Fully Accessible\, Gallery Hours:
