BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Latin Friday: Oscar D'Leon Tribute w Son D'Aqui & Afrolatino Dance
 !
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T230000
UID:blogto-233335@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/08/original_image270533f4-224f-46ec-a85b-055176f304
 a4.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Canada’s premier Latin music and dance club invites you to e
 xperience an unforgettable night of salsa — dinner\, dancing\, and live 
 music all under one roof!\nBook a table for dinner and dancing\, or arrive
  after 9 PM to head straight to the dance floor.\nEvening Schedule\n� 7:
 00 PM – Doors open for dinner and drinks\n� 9:00 PM – Salsa lesson w
 ith Afrolatino Dance (no partner needed!)\n� 10:00 PM – Live salsa set
 \n� 11:00 PM – Keep the energy going with Lula's Global Late Night Par
 ty!\nAbout the Band\nSon D'Aqui is an all-star Toronto Latin ensemble dedi
 cated to honouring and celebrating the classic repertoire of salsa through
  tributes to legendary figures in the genre's history. This week\, they ar
 e performing a tribute to the legendary Oscar D'Leon!\nWhy Lula is unique:
