BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Laugh & Learn: Smart Lectures and Stand-Up Comedy in Toronto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T210000
UID:blogto-233862@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/20/original_image16dbf735-76e0-420e-9e5f-a469b39a61
 49.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to laugh and learn with killer smart talks and stand
 -up comedy right here in Toronto!\nLaugh & Learn is where stand-up comedy 
 meets interesting ideas - all inside a relaxed bar setting.\nThe night sta
 rts with stand-up comedy to warm up the room\, followed by a short talk fr
 om an expert on a fascinating topic.\nNo lecture halls.\nNo exams.\nJust c
 uriosity\, laughter\, drinks\, and good people.\nLECTURE Topic: What Docto
 rs Really Think (But Can't Say) About Modern Life and Our Bodies\nA fascin
 ating talk on how modern habits\, health myths\, and everyday lifestyle ch
 oices are quietly affecting our bodies. Drawing from his experience in med
 icine and healthcare strategy\, Dr. Aman shares what doctors are seeing be
 hind the scenes of modern healthcare and why many of the biggest drivers o
 f health today have more to do with lifestyle than medicine.\nYOU’LL LEA
 RN:\n• The biggest health myths people still believe today\n• How mode
 rn habits like sitting\, stress\, and screen time affect our bodies\n• W
 hat doctors wish more people understood about preventing health problems\n
 • Why modern healthcare systems often focus on treatment rather than pre
 vention=\nSPEAKER: Dr. Aman Desai\, Physician & CEO\, Scalpels & Spreadshe
 ets\nDr. Aman Desai is a physician and healthcare entrepreneur who has wor
 ked across medicine\, healthcare strategy\, and digital health innovation.
  He focuses on improving how healthcare systems operate and how patients e
 xperience care.\nDr. Aman brings both medical insight and industry perspec
 tive to explain how modern life is shaping our health and what we can do a
 bout it.\nPERFECT FOR:\n• Curious minds\n• Comedy lovers\n• First da
 tes or low-pressure date nights\n• Solo attendees who enjoy social event
 s\n• Anyone bored with the usual “dinner + drinks” routine\nENJOY:\n
 😂 Live stand-up comedy\n🧠 A fascinating talk by a professor or exper
 t\n🍸 Drinks + relaxed bar vibes\n💬 Audience Q&A + conversation\n🤝
  Meet curious\, like-minded people\nWHERE:\nAce of Spades Lounge and Event
 s\n536 Manning Ave Lower Level\, Toronto\nWHEN:\nFriday\, April 24\, 2026\
 nDoors: 6 PM | Show: 7 PM (sharp)\nHOW:\nmany tickets do you need?\nBring 
 your friends\, date\, parents or just yourself. Grab a drink\, grab a seat
 \, and enjoy a night that blends comedy\, learning\, and conversation.\nTi
 ckets are limited - grab yours before they sell out.\nNOTE: Tickets at the
  door are subject to availability and may be sold at a higher price.\nAdva
 nce tickets strongly recommended.
LOCATION:Ace of Spades Lounge and Events
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/laugh-learn-smart-lectures-and-stand-up-
 comedy-in-toronto-toronto-2/
