BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Spark Dance - first anniversary edition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T223000
UID:blogto-233858@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/19/original_image81ee2bb5-89b8-44af-9305-1ec7cd7d96
 36.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Spark Dance 1-Year Anniversary\nDate: Friday\, April 24\, 2026
 \nTime: 7:30 PM – 10:30 PM\nLocation: Bain Co‑op Community Centre\, 10
 0 Bain Ave\, Toronto\nAbout the Event\nSpark Dance (formerly Spark Jam) ce
 lebrates one full year of live improvised music and open dance floors. Wha
 t began as a small experiment has grown into a beloved Toronto community g
 athering where musicians and dancers create together in real time.\nNo DJ.
  No set list. No choreography. Just a collective of live musicians respond
 ing directly to the energy of the dancers on the floor. The band watches\,
  listens\, and lets every sway\, stomp\, and stillness shape what comes ne
 xt.\nThe result is a dance floor that feels more connected\, more intimate
 \, and more alive — because your presence isn't just welcome\, it's esse
 ntial.\nWhat to Expect\nFully improvised live music by the Spark Dance col
 lective\nAn open\, barefoot‑friendly dance floor — move as much or as 
 little as you like\nSober\, welcoming\, low‑pressure atmosphere\nWarm at
 mosphere and community connection\nTickets\nPWYC (Pay What You Can) — to
  support the artists who make this magic happen.\nOnline: SparkDance.event
 brite.com\nE‑transfer: sparkjamto@gmail.com (any amount welcome)\n💌 I
 f cost is a barrier\, DM @ToSparkDance on Instagram — no one will be tur
 ned away.\nSchedule\n7:00 PM – Doors open\n7:30 PM – Music begins\n10:
 30 PM – Event ends\nPlease arrive by 7:30 PM to settle in and connect be
 fore the music starts.\nWhat to Bring\nWater bottle\nComfortable clothes f
 or movement\nA small snack to share (optional)\nCome celebrate one year of
  real‑time magic. The floor is waiting. ✨
LOCATION:Bain Co-op Community Centre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/spark-dance-first-anniversary-edition-to
 ronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
