BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TIK TOK BOOM - 60 Scenes in 60 Minutes
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T223000
UID:blogto-233923@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/21/original_image5b0ea8c9-71d0-45bc-94a6-e33483558f
 75.jpg
DESCRIPTION:One way to describe a sketch show is that it is “fast-paced.
 ” But how fast is fast? Can a sketch show go so fast that you might blin
 k once and miss your favourite scene?!\nGet ready for a rapid-fire rollerc
 oaster of laughs with TIK TOK BOOM — a high-octane\, one-act sketch come
 dy revue where time is on no one's side. Every sketch clocks in at two min
 utes or less\, delivering bite-sized\, TikTok-inspired blasts of absurdity
 \, satire and surprise!\nSmart\, silly\, and unapologetically fast — TIK
  TOK BOOM is what happens when comedy meets chaos\, and there's no time to
  explain.\n$15 March 28th\, 9:30 PM at Comedy Bar East\nAbout TIK TOK BOOM
 :\nThe cast features comedians Kara Austria\, Madeleine Brown\, Meghan Bow
 er\, Katie Chin\, Elanja Corosky\, Nessie Cran\, Biplob Ghosh\, Kent Penar
 anda\, Aaron Rubinoff and Miho Suzuki. They serve as the house sketch trou
 pe for CB Pro\, performing their marquee show monthly at Comedy Bar. Their
  individual credits as writers and performers include comedy festivals\, t
 heatre\, film and television worldwide. Graduates of Canada\, the US and U
 K’s major comedy institutions\, they’ve also won an award or two among
  them including The Tim Sims Encouragement Award\, Toronto Fringe Patrons'
  Picks\, Vancouver Fringe Spirit of the Fringe Award\, and the Ellen Ross 
 Stuart “Opening Doors” Award.
LOCATION:Comedy Bar Danforth
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/tik-tok-boom-60-scenes-in-60-minutes-tor
 onto-2/
