 ent is 19+)\n6:30pm - Arrival & Prom Photos\n7:00pm - Opening Container & 
 Embodiment\n7:30pm - Immersive Quest & Live DJs\n10:30pm - Soundbath & Clo
 sing Container\n11:00pm - Event Ends\nDress Code Suggestion: semi-formal\,
