 ar. Whatever that means for you. Your light is your unique signature. Tap 
 deep inside your own inner galaxy and ask what would that magic being insi
 de of you want to wear to their prom!? This night is for them to be seen.\
 nTickets on sale now!\nEarly Bird $50\nTier 1 $55\nTier 2 $60\nFor the DJ 
