 ed to the wealthy Gus Esmond (Tommy Noonan)\, much to the disapproval of G
 us’ rich father\, Esmond Sr.\, who thinks that Lorelei is just a gold di
 gger.\nWhen Lorelei goes on a cruise accompanied only by her best friend\,
  Dorothy Shaw (Jane Russell)\, Esmond Sr. hires Ernie Malone (Elliott Reid
 )\, a private detective\, to follow her and report any questionable behavi
 our. Many musical and romantic hijinks ensue as Monroe and Russell bring t
 he goddess energy that leaves all of the fellas on board frazzled.\nAdapte
 d by Anita Loos from her novel and directed by Howard Hawks\, the film fea
 tures several fun musical numbers including the iconic “Diamonds are a G
 irl’s Best Friend” which has inspired everything from Madonna’s “M
 aterial Girl” video to Ryan Gosling’s “I’m Just Ken” performance
  at the 2024 Oscar’s!\nPrepare to be dazzled!
