BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Art of Vietnamese Coffee: A Tasting Journey
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260426T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260426T140000
UID:blogto-233717@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/15/original_image42bd2480-951e-4822-91e8-1da5b382ec
 5e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:An immersive afternoon of Vietnamese iced coffee and egg coffe
 e featuring guided tastings\, sensory exploration\, and cultural storytell
 ing.\nThe Art of Vietnamese Coffee: A Tasting Journey\nWelcome to tinglesb
 ar Hangouts - a series of unique and interactive sensory experiences with 
 other ASMR fans - this time\, step inside the world of Vietnamese coffee c
 ulture and experience parts of it for yourself\, through a multisensory ri
 tual. Led by the team of Caphelia Coffee shop.\nWhat to Expect:\n☕️ Gu
 ided tasting of Vietnamese (“phin” filtered) coffees: Experience two f
 eatured flavours – Vietnamese iced coffee and egg coffee as you learn wh
 at makes each one distinct.\n🧑🏻‍🍳 LIVE Demos on how to make you
 r own at home using traditional filters.\n⁠😌 Sensory exploration: Eng
 age with the aromas\, textures\, sounds\, and atmosphere surrounding the c
 offee experience.\n🇻🇳 Stories behind the drinks: Learn about the tra
 ditions\, preparation\, and cultural context behind each featured coffee.\
 n🎁 Raffle prize: Enter a draw to win a special prize from Caphelia Coff
 ee Shop!\nNOTE: Dietary restrictions cannot be accommodated for the tastin
 g. A full list of ingredients can be provided on-site.\nTickets sit at $30
 . Use code morningcoffee for an early bird discount until the week of the 
 event!\nAbout tinglesbar\ntinglesbar is the world’s first dedicated ASMR
  spa and collective\, redefining wellness through immersive\, sensory-rich
  experiences grounded in ASMR\, creativity\, and human connection. From pe
 rsonalized treatments to immersive group gatherings\, we offer multisensor
 y escapes designed around soothing triggers (hair brushing\, back scratchi
 ng\, soundscapes\, and more). A sanctuary to reset\, relax\, and reconnect
 —where mindful stimulation meets modern self-care.\nAbout Caphelia\nA pl
 ay on words\, Cafe + Philia = Caphelia is a representation of the affectio
 nate love for coffee. This cozy coffee shop is owned and operated by a cou
 ple with one goal in mind: holding space. At Caphelia\, coffee is a connec
 tion. Be it early mornings with friends or the fateful encounters with str
 angers\, each cup is crafted with robusta beans from Vietnam that share th
 eir passion for quality and sustainability.
LOCATION:tinglesbar ASMR Spa
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-art-of-vietnamese-coffee-a-tasting-j
 ourney-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
