 a5.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Sunday Funday with your favourites - board games
 \, Mario Kart\, karaoke\, and even mahjong all at Sugar Cafe in Richmond H
 ill.\nTired of always going downtown for a night out or missing out on wee
 knight events? We got you!\nOn Sunday\, April 26\, we’re bringing the vi
 bes uptown.\nJoin us at Sugar Cafe & Lounge in Richmond Hill for a fun\, l
 ow-pressure social mixer designed for people who just want to get out\, me
 et others\, and actually do something fun.\nNo awkward formats.\nJust a re
 ally good room.\nToronto Event Hub by Andrea Lo has been the one behind To
 ronto Game Night & Toronto Dating Hub and have been hosting game night soc
 ials around the GTA every month for the past 5 years!\n✨ What makes this
  different?\nWe’ve built in things to do—so you’re never stuck in sm
 all talk:\n🎲 Casual group icebreaker\n🎮 Mario Kart + board games\n
 🎤 Karaoke\n🀄 Mahjong\n🍸 Great food & drinks\nWhether you come sol
 o or with friends\, it’s easy to jump in\, meet people naturally\, and h
 ave fun without overthinking it.\n📅 When?\nSun Apr 26 5-8pm\n📍 Where
 ?\nSugar Cafe & Lounge\n✨ What?\n👯‍♀️ Come solo or bring your c
 rew\n💬 Open to singles\, friends\, couples (ages 19+)—everyone’s we
 lcome\n🎟 Limited spots to keep the vibe right\nIf you’ve been wanting
  a fun Sunday plan without trekking downtown… this is it.\nPricing:\nThe
  first spots are FREE (as long as you spend $20 food or drink order). Plea
