 ers your entrance & access to games\, etc for 3 hours and the event hostin
 g\, curation & organization. Eventbrite charges separate fees to use their
  service. No refunds.\nDrop in rate is $20 at the door payable by cash or 
 etransfer- IF WE HAVE SPOTS.\nhttps://www.torontoeventhub.com/events
