 e5.jpg
DESCRIPTION:TorontoTrivia.com presents: Almost Jeopardy?* Trivia Night - T
 oronto's favourite Trivia Night every other Wednesday with fresh new quest
 ions at Hemingway's!\nEach week we have a brand new quiz to challenge your
  team in the quest for Trivia Glory. The things you'll see in the quiz mig
 ht be on your episode when YOU appear on a big time TV game show one day. 
 Gather your team\, test your trivia skills\, and dig into a new theme roun
 d each week.\nHOW IT WORKS\n3 Rounds\, 10 Questions each\nRound 1: General
  Knowledge - anything goes!\nRound 2: Theme Round - a new theme is announc
 ed each week @AlmostJeopardy so study up!\nRound 3: Almost Jeopardy?* Roun
 d - two sets of five questions inspired by our favourite game show\nFinal 
 Question - It all comes down to this: bet your points on one last question
 . Our glorious winners will be crowned smartest team in the room and you'l
 l walk away with great prizes from Hemingway's.\n* not affiliated with the
  show in any way\, obviously\nTRIVIA DETAILS\n🕕 Doors open at 6:00 PM. 
 Arrive early\, grab a themed drink\, and get settled in.\n❓ First questi
 on at 7:00 PM sharp. Don’t be late.\n🏆 The top three teams win a Hem
 ’s gift card valued between $50 and $100.
