 gto.com/events/2026/04/21/original_image49c9d6fd-96a8-4c20-ac68-fb2ea31846
 5f.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a late-night dance party following the earlier sal
 sa set. Light menu available until midnight.\nToronto's Weekly Global Afte
 rparty!\nEvery Friday night at 11 PM\, Lula elevates the party to the next
  level!\nFollowing our weekly live Latin band\, Lula now features local an
 d international bands and DJs playing high-energy global beats to keep the
  dance floor moving late into the night.\nBRASA\nPart of Lula Lounge’s G
 lobal Late Night series\, BRASA brings the heat of Brazil’s musical lega
 cy to the dance floor. The word brasa means ember—that glowing\, red-hot
  coal—and it’s the perfect metaphor for the sound: warm\, rhythmic\, a
 nd impossible to ignore. Drawing from the rich traditions of Brazilian sou
 l\, samba-rock\, and Tropicália\, BRASA\, led by keyboardist João Leão\
 , delivers a vibrant set of groove-driven classics and contemporary gems i
 nspired by icons like Jorge Ben\, João Donato\, Marcos Valle\, and Tim Ma
 ia\, alongside newer Brazilian sounds. Expect deep rhythms\, infectious me
 lodies\, and dance floor hits.\nArrive at 11 pm and enjoy some of the Lati
 n orchestra before the late-night global party begins!\nLate kitchen • L
 ate last call\nBottle Service\nReservations for bottle service can be made
  by calling 416 588 0307.\nPlease note that these tickets are general admi
 ssion and do not guarantee seating. Buy early and get the early bird disco
 unt!
LOCATION:Lula Lounge
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/global-late-night-featuring-brasa-toront
 o/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
