 e to disrupt those supply chains. Speakers include Jody Chan (No Arms in t
 he Arts)\, Mostafa Heneway (Immigrant Rights Network) and others to be ann
 ounced\, moderated by Moe Alqasem (Labour for Palestine).\nLive Music: Par
 allel Play Collective
