BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CONTACT Photography Festival: "The Water Between Us" by Meaghan Og
 ilvie
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260502T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260502T160000
UID:blogto-233798@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/17/original_imagefed674fb-a07c-41ed-b086-bac513fb59
 58.jpg
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of the CONTACT Photography Festival\, the River
 dale Hub is pleased to present a photography exhibition “The Water Betwe
 en Us” by Meaghan Ogilvie. On display from April 28th to May 30th\, 2026
 .\nJoin us on May 2nd for opening reception from 2 to 4pm\, artist talk be
 gins at 3pm.\nThis exhibition presents a captivating retrospective of Meag
 han Ogilvie’s work\, tracing more than a decade of her artistic journey.
  Known for her award-winning underwater photography\, Ogilvie explores the
  delicate relationship between humans and water through imagery that is bo
 th ethereal and deeply rooted in environmental awareness. Featuring highli
 ghts from international exhibitions\, artist residencies\, and major publi
 c art commissions\, the show reflects the evolution of her practice—from
  early explorations to her most celebrated projects. Together\, these work
 s offer an intimate look at an artist whose lens transforms water into a p
 owerful\, poetic medium for connection\, memory\, and reflection.\nAbout t
 he CONTACT Photography Festival\nThe CONTACT Photography Festival is an an
 nual city-wide festival that began in 1997. It encompasses exhibitions\, p
 ublic art installations\, and programs that feature the work of local and 
 international lens-based artists every May.
LOCATION:Riverdale Hub
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/contact-photography-festival-the-water-b
 etween-us-by-meaghan-ogilvie-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
