BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:THE EMPEROR-Beethoven\, Shostakovich\, Bach
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260502T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260502T213000
UID:blogto-219486@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2025/06/10/original_image4445fb43-5ff8-4018-aca7-a6930f197b
 78.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Sinfonia Toronto wraps up its 2025-26 season with works of ete
 rnal genius. The superb young Toronto pianist Vanessa Yu joins the ensembl
 e in one of the greatest concertos of all time\, Beethoven's noble Piano C
 oncerto No. 5\, the "Emperor". Music Director Nurhan Arman leads the orche
 stra in Dmitri Shostakovich's poignant and personal Chamber Symphony in C 
 minor\, Op. 110a and finishes with the powerful reassurance of J.S. Bach's
  Contrapunctus 1 and 2 in beautifully transparent orchestral versions.\nPr
 ices: Adult $44.25 / Senior (60+) $35.40 / Student $20\, plus HST
LOCATION:George Weston Recital Hall\, Meridian Arts Centre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-emperor-beethoven-shostakovich-bach-
 toronto/
