 gto.com/events/2026/04/16/original_imageaadfe99b-6653-4c37-aca5-1db7d8ee4b
 fe.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Typewriters & Tapas is BACK! Experience gourmet bites as you l
 earn to use vintage typewriters to turn short conversations into personali
 zed poems for the people you meet.\nJoin us for an afternoon of great food
 \, even better company\, and lots of creativity on vintage typewriters. Th
 is is a guided workshop-meets-supper-club experience for all skill levels.
 \nFrom 1–4 PM\, we’ll gather for gourmet tapas and drinks while learni
 ng how to turn short conversations into personalized poems for each other 
 on vintage typewriters\, before sealing them into envelopes with wax for a
  take-home keepsake. Perfect for every level (yes\, even if you haven’t 
 written since high school!).\nThis is all about connecting over food and c
 reativity. Whether you’re here for the tapas or the typewriters\, we’d
  love to have you at the table—book your spot early\, as we keep it inti
 mate.\nWhat’s Included:\n- Gourmet tapas and drinks\n-  Vintage typewrit
 ers\, wax sealing\, ink-dipped quills\, and custom stationery\n-  A take-h
 ome notebook and premium paper\n-  A welcoming space to meet people and ge
 t creative\nWhat to Expect:\n- A relaxed eat-yap-create environment to mee
 t like-minded people\n- A social workshop experience to connect and turn c
 onversations into short poems\n- Delicious tapas and drinks\nThis is for y
 ou if…\n- You love analogue activities that get you out of your comfort 
 zone (and off your screen)\n- You enjoy meeting new and friendly people\n-
  You need a good laugh\, and maybe a good cry\n- You live for good food an
 d good conversation\nBy the end\, you’ll walk away with:\n- 2–3 short 
 poems\, typewritten and sealed with wax (one written for yourself and 1–
 2 written by someone you meet)\n- A fresh spark of creativity (and maybe a
  new friend at the table)\n- A notebook full of ideas and inspiration so y
 ou can continue your writing streak\nPerfect for a unique solo date\, frie
 nd date\, or romantic date—honestly\, bring your grandma.\nThis is a gre
 at way to spend an afternoon differently. Whether you’re here for the ta
 pas or the typewriters\, we’d love to have you at the table. Book your s
 pot early—we keep it intimate.\nEvent: May 3\, 2026 | 1–4 PM @ Gezelli
 g Studios\nTicket: $159.99
LOCATION:Gezellig Studios
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/a-special-collab-typewriters-tapas-round
 -2-toronto/
