 eekend! We are thrilled to invite you to the Toronto Island Community 2026
  Yard Sale & Scavenge\, taking place across the beautiful Wards and Algonq
 uin Island on Saturday\, May 9th\, and Sunday\, May 10th.\nWhether you are
  a seasoned collector searching for rare antiques or a casual explorer loo
 king to enjoy a sunny day by the water\, this event offers something for e
 veryone.\nThis year’s official map serves as your essential guide to nav
 igating the festivities. Every marked location highlights a mix of traditi
 onal Yard Sales and generous Give-Away spots where free goodies are waitin
 g for a new home. You can expect to find everything from vintage clothing 
 and unique household finds to one-of-a-kind island treasures.\nView the 20
 26 Map here: https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=11E4cPg1BMGmXAsMa45b
 WDxu04Zuj9kE\nAs you prepare for your adventure\, please remember to bring
