 na and will take place at Assembly Park\, Vaughan in the IKEA Plaza conven
 ient for area residents and visitors from all over. Produced by Ontario Fe
 stival Group.\nFeaturing North America’s Best Rib Teams ready to serve y
 ou\, your friends and family Award-Winning Mouth-Watering BBQ Smoked Ribs\
