 y Tribal Crackling Wind\, running May 15–17\, 2026 at the Winchester Str
 eet Theatre.\nHonouring tradition while embracing new directions\, Worn In
 heritance brings together a series of solo works created by Peter Chin and
  performed by acclaimed artists William Lau\, Marina Acevedo\, and Derek S
 ouvannavong. The program offers a rich exploration of identity\, memory\, 
 and cultural lineage\, drawing from influences across Canada\, Mexico\, La
 os\, Cambodia\, and China.
