 cocktails\nCrafted with premium rums and bold flavours\, from bright and r
 efreshing to deep and aromatic.\nGuided rum tasting experience\nCheck out 
 the rum tasting booths and discover the stories\, styles\, and flavours be
 hind some of the world’s most iconic rums.\nRum masterclasses\nThe conno
 isseurs ticket gives you access to a breakaway rum masterclass where you w
 ill learn about the history of rum and a deep dive into the featured brand
 .\nDominoes & classic games\nPull up to the table\, drop a six (or get one
