 ’s premier a cappella festival (singing without instruments). Held every
  year in May\, SING! presents a week of outstanding concerts featuring the
  human voice. We bring together thousands of professional singers (Canadia
 n and international)\, students\, teachers\, divas and in-the-shower belte
 rs.\nWe aim to:\n\nCreate a safe space for learning.\nIllustrate that the 
 voice has no limits – knows no constraints of genre\, language or cultur
 al background.\nAsk participants to step outside their comfort zones and t
 ry something new\nEducate and inspire today’s youth\nFoster a new and re
 vitalized patronage for the vocal arts.\n
