 their limits.\nAssemble your team\, think fast\, and trust your instincts 
 because in this room\, every answer counts.\nTRIVIA DETAILS\n🕕 Doors op
 en at 6:00 PM. Arrive early\, grab a themed drink\, and get settled in.\n
