 cond year on June 6–7\, 2026. This year\, the festival moves from its pr
 evious October slot to a summer weekend at the RBC Amphitheatre. The festi
 val is known for its inclusive atmosphere and a single-stage format with n
 o overlapping set times.\nThe 2026 edition features a curated lineup of al
 ternative\, pop\, and indie artists.\nSaturday\, June 6: Headlined by Kesh
 a and Toronto's own The Beaches.\nSupporting acts: Rachel Chinouriri\, Hol
 ly Humberstone\, Sofia Camara\, and Bella Kay.\nSunday\, June 7: Headlined
  by Lorde and Wet Leg.\nSupporting acts: Del Water Gap\, Jade LeMac\, Momm
 a\, and Flower Face\nTickets available @ https://eventschaser.com/?s=All+T
 hings+Go+Music+Festival
