 ed for everyone. Expect a moderate\, feel-good flow with no complicated po
 ses\, just stretching\, movement\, and bonding time with your dog.\nWhethe
 r you are new to yoga or a regular on the mat\, this class is all about co
 mmunity and connection.\nReceive a drink ticket\, which you can redeem at 
