  healing.\nWe'll guide you through a sequence of relationship-building exe
 rcises with up to 20 singles.\nEach exercise will aid you and your date in
  playfully exploring the depth of your connection. (Think verbal dyads\, m
 ovement/dancing\, and communication games!)\nAnd all of them enhance your 
 relationship skills in subtle\, yet powerful ways.\nSo you'll walk away no
 t only with matches...\nBut with the tools you need to bring more love int
 o your dating life!\nOver 31\,759 singles have gone on 232\,747 dates in 5
 0+ cities worldwide. 94.09% have matched with one or more dates. If you do
 n't match\, your next event is on us!\nGet your ticket today and experienc
 e the magic participants from New York to Vancouver-to now Amsterdam!-are 
 raving about!\nSingles are raving about their tantra speed dating experien
 ce:\n* "Unquestionably the best dating event I have ever attended. It's tr
 ansformative!" -John N.\n* "I met the love of my life! I was hesitant to g
 o but I'm SO glad I did!" -Catherine B. (Denver)\n* "I now feel that I hav
 e a much deeper understanding of what it means to be a man in a relationsh
 ip and how to make dating a beautiful experience." -Justin M.\n* "I really
  felt like a goddess surrounded by strong\, beautiful\, empowered men." -B
 randi D.\nFor all dates in Toronto\, ON visit:\nhttps://www.tantrany.com/s
 peed-dating/toronto/\nFor all cities worldwide or to check out our FAQ\, v
 isit:\nhttps://www.tantrany.com/speed-dating/\nURLs:\nTickets: https://go.
 evvnt.com/3579227-0?pid=4146\nWebsite: https://go.evvnt.com/3579227-2?pid=
