 a7.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Greetings!\nWe are delighted to cordially invite you to the 5t
 h World Pediatrics\, Perinatology\, and Emergency Pediatrics Care Summit &
  Exhibition\, scheduled to take place from June 18–20\, 2026\, in Dubai\
 , United Arab Emirates\, on behalf of the Utilitarian Conferences Committe
 e.\nPEDIATRICSUCG2026\nConference Theme:\n“Advancing Global Pediatric Ca
 re Through Innovation\, Early Intervention\, and Collaborative Clinical Pr
 actice.”\nThis premier Pediatrics Summit will bring together leading exp
 erts\, clinicians\, researchers\, and healthcare professionals from around
  the world to explore the latest developments in pediatrics\, neonatology\
 , perinatology\, and emergency pediatric care.\nConference Venue\nDubai\, 
 UAE & Online\nAt UCGConferences\, you will gain insights into practical\, 
 real-world applications in the fast-evolving field of pediatric and neonat
 al healthcare. Participants will engage with global leaders through keynot
 e lectures\, panel discussions\, poster presentations\, workshops\, and a 
 Young Researchers Forum focused on emerging technologies and pediatric car
 e innovations.\nThis summit offers exceptional opportunities for internati
 onal networking\, collaboration\, and knowledge exchange.\nConference Aim\
 nThe goal of the summit is to provide a global platform for sharing knowle
 dge\, discussing breakthrough advancements\, and promoting multidisciplina
 ry collaboration in:\nPediatrics\nNeonatology\nPerinatology\nEmergency Ped
 iatrics\nChild Health Research\nPediatric Surgery\nPediatric Intensive Car
 e\nPediatric Nutrition\nDevelopmental Medicine\nWe welcome:\nExpert Commit
 tee Members\, Plenary Speakers\, Keynote Speakers\, Pediatricians\, Neonat
 ologists\, Perinatologists\, Pediatric Surgeons\, Researchers\, Nurses\, C
 linical Scientists\, Pharmacologists\, Child Health Specialists\, Delegate
 s\, Exhibitors\, Sponsors\, Students\, Young Researchers\, and Healthcare 
 Industry Leaders.\nTarget Audience\nPediatricians\, Neonatologists & Perin
 atologists\nPediatric Surgeons\, Pediatric Emergency Physicians\nChild Hea
 lth Researchers\nNICU & PICU Professionals\nPediatric Nurses & Nurse Pract
 itioners\nPediatric Nutritionists & Dietitians\nChild Psychologists & Beha
 vioral Experts\nDevelopmental Specialists\nPharmacists & Clinical Research
 ers\nHospital Administrators & Policy Makers\nBiomedical Scientists & Tech
 nologists\nMedical Device Developers\nStudents\, Scholars\, and Young Inve
 stigators\nHealthcare Executives & Industry Representatives\nParticipants 
 will exchange insights on the latest clinical practices\, challenges\, inn
 ovations\, and global trends shaping pediatric healthcare.\nMore than 70 i
 nternational and regional speakers will deliver visionary talks across mul
 tiple specialized sessions.\nExperience the Summit\nExpect:\nBreakthrough 
 research presentations\nInteractive workshops\nEngaging panel discussions\
 nLive demonstrations\nExhibitor showcases\nNetworking sessions with global
  leaders\nThe 5WPEC2026 Program seeks to inspire collaboration and spark m
 eaningful dialogue to elevate pediatric and neonatal healthcare standards 
 worldwide.\nMark Your Calendar: June 18–20\, 2026\nPrepare your abstract
 s\, posters\, and case reports\, and invite your colleagues to be part of 
 the most impactful Pediatrics\, Perinatology\, and Emergency Care Summit y
 et.\nWe look forward to welcoming you and ensuring your experience is both
  enriching and memorable.\nConference Tracks & Key Sessions\nExplore sessi
 ons at:\n🔗 https://pediatrics.utilitarianconferences.com/scientific-ses
 sions\nHighlighted Tracks Include:\nTrack 1: General Pediatrics\nTrack 2: 
 Neonatology\nTrack 3: Perinatology\nTrack 4: Pediatric Emergency Medicine\
 nTrack 5: Pediatric Surgery\nTrack 6: Pediatric Cardiology\nTrack 7: Pedia
 tric Neurology\nTrack 8: Pediatric Oncology\nTrack 9: Pediatric Endocrinol
 ogy\nTrack 10: Pediatric Nutrition\nTrack 11: Pediatric Infectious Disease
 s\nTrack 12: Pediatric Pulmonology\nTrack 13: Pediatric Dermatology\nTrack
  14: Pediatric Gastroenterology\nTrack 15: Child Psychology & Mental Healt
 h\nTrack 16: Pediatric Nephrology\nTrack 17: Pediatric Immunology\nTrack 1
 8: Pediatric Critical Care\nAnd many more…\nAbstract Submission is Now O
 pen!\nBrowse topics & submit your abstract here:\n🔗 https://pediatrics.
 utilitarianconferences.com/submit-abstract\nConference Benefits\n21 CME Ho
 urs\n21 CPD Hours\nLive Interactive Sessions\nMeet Experts & Investors\nPr
 oduct Showcases\nCertificate of Recognition\nGlobal Industrial Exhibitions
 \nPublication of Accepted Abstracts\nNetworking for Future Collaboration\n
 Career Advancement Opportunities\nEmployment Bureau\nYoung Researchers For
 um\nPanel Discussions & Q/A\nAccess to Cutting-Edge Research\nAbout CME & 
 CPD\nCME (Continuing Medical Education) provides focused clinical learning
  essential for maintaining medical licensing and staying updated with adva
 ncements.\nCPD (Continuing Professional Development) encompasses broader p
 rofessional skills\, including leadership\, communication\, and healthcare
  management.\nBoth are fundamental for improving competency and delivering
  high-quality pediatric care.\nWhy Dubai\, UAE?\nDubai is a global hub for
 :\nHealthcare innovation\nTourism & culture\nBusiness and technology\nConv
 enient international connectivity\nIt offers world-class hospitality and v
 ibrant experiences\, ensuring an exceptional conference environment.\nWorr
 ied About the UAE Visa?\nWe will provide full visa assistance once you reg
 ister as a Speaker\, Listener\, or Poster Presenter\, including:\nRequired
  Documents\nVisa Interview Guidelines\nStep-by-step Visa Process\nAppointm
 ent Support\nOfficial Invitation Letter\nThe UAE has a high visa success r
 ate\, and multiple-entry visas are available to most nationalities.\nSuppo
 rting Journals & Community\nUnified Citation Journals\nA leading platform 
 for publishing scientific advancements across healthcare\, clinical resear
 ch\, engineering\, and life sciences.\nLearn more: https://ucjournals.com/
 journals/\nUtilitarian Conferences Gathering\nA global organizer of medica
 l\, scientific\, and academic events with a commitment to quality and inno
 vation.\nMore Information: https://utilitarianconferences.com/\nImportant 
 Information\nConference Name: 5th World Pediatrics\, Perinatology\, and Em
 ergency Pediatrics Care Summit & Exhibition\nShort Name: PEDIATRICSUCG2026
 \nDates: June 18–20\, 2026\nVenue: Dubai\, UAE & Online\nEmail: info-ucg
 @utilitarianconferences.com\nWhatsApp: +971551792927\nWebsite: https://ped
 iatrics.utilitarianconferences.com/\nSubmit Abstract:\nhttps://pediatrics.
 utilitarianconferences.com/submit-abstract\nRegistration:\nhttps://pediatr
 ics.utilitarianconferences.com/registration\nVirtual Registration:\nhttps:
 //pediatrics.utilitarianconferences.com/virtual-registration\nExhibitor Re
 gistration:\nhttps://pediatrics.utilitarianconferences.com/exhibitor-regis
 tration\nSponsor Registration:\nhttps://pediatrics.utilitarianconferences.
 com/sponsor-registration\nSocial Media:\nTwitter: https://x.com/dr_edwards
 76774\nLinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/m-padma-pradhan-30906a386/\nI
 nstagram: https://www.instagram.com/dr.lizaedwards/?hl=en\nYouTube: https:
 //www.youtube.com/@utilitarianconferencesgath3347
