 g long. The stage comes alive with electrifying performances by legendary 
 Toronto queens Ayah Conic\, STORM\, and Who?\, bringing charisma\, talent\
 , and unforgettable looks. Hosting the night is the incomparable Sucka Que
 en\, guiding the festivities with wit\, warmth\, and plenty of sparkle.\nB
 etween performances\, strike a pose at themed photo ops and booths\, get c
 reative at the bracelet-making station\, and raise a glass at the cash bar
