 re\nA lively\, welcoming space filled with music\, energy\, and global vib
 es in the heart of the city.\n📍 Event Details\nLocation: Sankofa Square
 \nDate: June 21\, 2026\nTime: 11:00 AM – 10:00 PM\nEntry: Free\n👨‍
 👩‍👧‍👦 Who Should Attend\nWhether you're:\nexploring Toronto\n
 looking for things to do with friends or family\nor simply love food\, mus
 ic\, and culture\n👉 This event is for you.\n🎟️ Don’t Miss Out\nB
 ring your friends\, bring your energy\, and be part of a celebration that 
 connects cultures through unforgettable experiences.\nFree entry!
LOCATION:Sankofa Square (Younge -Dundas Square)
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/global-fest-2026-toronto/
