 ndustries.\n​Career Growth: Explore certificate programs\, diplomas\, an
 d specialized training to enhance your skill set.\n​Networking: Build va
 luable professional connections within the local business community.\n​R
 esource Hub: Discover resources for resume building\, interview preparatio
 n\, and career transition.\n​Whether you are a recent graduate\, a seaso
 ned professional seeking a career change\, or looking to upgrade your qual
 ifications\, this event offers the tools and connections you need to succe
 ed in today's job market. Admission is free!\n​Date: Wednesday\, June 24
