DESCRIPTION:In this immersive TFS Summer Academy\, participants work with 
 Toronto Film School instructors to explore the craft of acting in a suppor
 tive\, hands-on environment. You’ll develop foundational skills includin
 g character work\, script analysis\, blocking\, stagecraft\, and camera aw
 areness while learning how to be authentic and truthful in a role. Guided 
 by experienced industry professionals\, you’ll prepare scenes for both l
 ive performance and industry-standard self-tapes\, building confidence\, c
 ontrol\, and expressive range.\nThis week-long Acting Academy offers an in
 troductory look at the same practical\, industry-focused training delivere
 d in Toronto Film School’s full-time Acting for Film\, TV and Theatre Di
 ploma Program.\n***Applicants must be entering Grade 11 or 12 and be 17 or
  younger at the academy’s end.\nToronto Film School – Summer Acting Ac
 ademy for Teens!\n•	June 29 to July 3 (no class on July 1) from 9 a.m. t
 o 5 p.m.\n•	$650
LOCATION:Toronto Film School
