 ided by working industry professionals\, you’ll collaborate with peers w
 hile creating a finished short film you can use as your first portfolio pi
 ece. This week-long academy offers an introductory taste of the same hands
 -on\, industry-driven learning that fuels Toronto Film School’s full-tim
 e Film Production Diploma Program.\n***Applicants must be entering Grade 1
